        "heading": "Patio vs Deck: The Difference Between a Deck and a Patio & How to Decide",
        "lede": "A patio covers the ground. A deck gives you a level, dry outdoor living space that starts at your back door, and its upkeep stays on the surface where you can see it. Here’s how a deck and a patio compare on build, maintenance, durability and resale value.",
